(10) The City shall not commence an action to enforce a lien under this section if it has commenced an action for a writ of garnishment with respect to the unpaid fine, costs or payment under Section 3-2-28 of this Code, pursuant to Section 4027 of the Michigan Revised Judicature Act of 1961, being MCL 600.4027; and

