(3) The Airport Department shall represent the City in all aviation matters affecting the interests of the City;

(4) The Airport Department shall have supervision, management and control of all City properties and equipment devoted to aviation activities, both as to supervision, maintenance and operation, except for Police Department equipment utilized at the Airport;

