1. The Digital Video Unit (DVR) may consist of either a single, or series of modular self-contained units capable of video image export via CD/DVD, SD card, and/or USB thumb drive. The DVR(s) may be "PC" based utilizing the Microsoft Windows operating system or, in the alternative, a dedicated device. The DVR(s) must record at a rate of at least seven images per second, per camera. Motion activated systems must record at a rate of seven images per second, per camera, hen activated.

