commercial space, or any other real property; or to make any record or inquiry in connection with the prospective purchase, rental or lease of any real property, multiple-apartment dwelling, commercial space, or housing accommodation which expresses, directly or indirectly, any limitation, specification, or discrimination with respect thereto;

(7) To offer, solicit, accept, use, or return a listing of real property, commercial space, multiple-apartment dwelling or housing accommodation where there exists a reasonable likelihood that any person may be discriminated against in a real estate transaction or in the furnishing of facilities or services in connection therewith; or

(8) Discriminate against a person in the brokering or appraising of real property.

