(a) Notwithstanding any other provision of this Code, the Chief of Mobility Innovation may temporarily issue any permit, license, or other form of authorization that is required or provided for by this Code for the deployment of an innovative technology within the Transportation Innovation Zone, including, but not limited to, a permit to obstruct or encumber any public place or right-of-way. As used in this section, "innovative technology" means any new or emerging technology, or novel use of an existing technology, to address a local problem or provide a local benefit in government administration, government services, non-profit organizations, or private enterprise.

