(4) The permit, license, or authorization is not transferable to another person or location;

(5) The Chief of Mobility Innovation, in consultation with the Office of Disability Affairs and a department director or agency who may otherwise issue the approval, shall apply any regulation or provision of this Code related to the permit, license, or authorization that he or she determines is necessary to protect the health, safety, or general welfare of the public;

