(7) The Chief of Mobility Innovation may direct the appropriate department or agency to take enforcement action against the recipient of the permit, license, or authorization.

(c) This section does not preclude the issuance of a permit, license, or authorization under any other provision of this Code.

(d) An application for a permit, license, or authorization under this section shall be submitted on a form and in a manner approved by the Office of Mobility Innovation.

