Pursuant to Section 10(5) of the Act, being MCL 484.3110(5), the Chief Financial Officer shall file an annual report with the Authority on the use and disposition of funds annually distributed by the Authority. (Code 1984, § 9.5-5-14; Ord. No. 21-02, § 1(9.5-5-14), eff. 11-1-2002)

**Sec. 45-2-16. Cable television operators.**

Pursuant to Section 13(6) of the Act, being MCL 484.3113(6), the City shall not hold a cable television operator in default or seek any remedy for its failure to satisfy an obligation, if any, to pay after November 1, 2002, the effective date of the Act, a franchise fee or similar fee on the portion of gross revenues from charges the cable operator received for cable modern service provided through broadband Internet transport access services. (Code 1984, § 9.5-5-15; Ord. No. 21-02, § 1(9.5-5-15), eff. 11-1-2002)

