(1) *Requests that pertain to property not owned by the City.* Upon completion of the Committee’s review, the request, with a written summary of the Committee’s findings and/or recommendations, shall be forwarded to the applicant by first class mail, and a copy of such documents shall be sent to the Director of the Buildings, Safety Engineering, and Environmental Department, and all members of the Wireless Telecommunications Site Review Committee. The Committee’s response shall also include the name, address, and telephone number of a person whom the applicant may contact to discuss any questions or comments the applicant may

